BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2204c8763532c4a6@neighbourhood-events
DTSTAMP:20260903T190540Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260908
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260908
SUMMARY:5-7pm Organic Produce Baskets from Nadir Farm
LOCATION:La Vieille Chéchette\, Bruxelles
URL:https://chechette.be/events/17h-19h-paniers-bio-ferme-de-nadir/
DESCRIPTION:Fresh vegetable baskets all year round! Each year\, household
 s commit to picking up a weekly vegetable basket and building local food
  sovereignty. This is our CSA\, our Community Supported Agriculture. The
  basket contents are a delightful mix of classic vegetables and exciting
  new flavors that we cultivate without fertilizers\, pesticides\, herbic
