URL:https://maisonpoeme.be/
DESCRIPTION:As part of the Philosophy Evenings at Maison poème\, a meeti
 ng with Québécois author and theater artist Catherine Dorion\, discuss
 ing her book The Courage and the Joy\, subtitled "Crossing the Fascist S
 torm Without Losing Your Way". The discussion will be moderated by indep
 endent journalist Manon Legrand (Vie Féminine\, Axelle\, Alter Echos...
 ).\nhttps://maisonpoeme.be/
