 eptember-2026/
DESCRIPTION:Presents: "Two Minute Chance" - A hilarious performance featu
 ring catchy sing-alongs delivered in authentic Brussels dialect. These a
 re the key ingredients of this singing duo. Daniël Robbrecht and Peter 
 Decabooter bring Brussels humor back to life with synthesizer\, guitar\,
  and their distinctive two-part harmonies. Expect a mix of imaginative B
 russels renditions of well-known songs alongside their original repertoi
 re\, all performed in the 'Vloms' Brussels style. "Two Minute Chance" de
 livers atmosphere\, conviviality\, and fun. Sunday\, September 27\, 2026
  at Het Goudblommeke in Papier at 3 PM.\nhttps://goudblommekeinpapier.be
 /event/twie-meneute-chance-zondag-27-september-2026/
